{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1240 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "42a3393f5875284331339c905d099915e1bec706cee48671bf4e8ed6b8cb2717" :edb/db-before-t 1239 :edb/db-after-t 1240 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534552 50 #inst "2026-10-12T02:45:42.925Z" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186190324 1078 #edb/ref 17592186190327 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186192675 1038 #edb/ref 17592186425377 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186192677 1038 #edb/ref 17592186425378 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186192677 1038 #edb/ref 17592186425379 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186193073 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186193073 1071 "Given that $X$ is a continuous random variable with the following probability density function, compute $E[5X - 2]$.\n\n$f(x) = {1 - x^{3},\\begin{vmatrix}0 < x \\le 1, \\\\ \\frac{1}{8},\\end{vmatrix}1 \\le x < 3$." 13194139534552 17592186045417 false] [17592186193073 1071 "Given that $X$ is a continuous random variable with the following probability density function, compute $\\text{E}[5X-2].$\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}1-{x}^{3}, & 0<x\\le 1, \\\\ \\frac{1}{8}, & 1\\le x<3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186193073 1074 "First, we simplify using the properties of the expected value:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[5X-2]=5\\text{E}[X]-2\n$$\n\nFor a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ we can calculate the expected value using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\int }_{S}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, we calculate the expected value of $X$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\cdot (1-{x}^{3})\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{3}x\\cdot \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(x-{x}^{4})\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{3}\\frac{x}{8}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{x}^{5}}{5})|}_{0}^{1}+{\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16}|}_{1}^{3} \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{5})-0+(\\frac{9}{16}-\\frac{1}{16})-0 \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{10}+\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[5X-2] & =5\\text{E}[X]-2 \\\\  & =5\\cdot \\frac{4}{5}-2 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425359 1080 "\\frac{1}{3}" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425359 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425359 1083 #uuid "0ae0644f-0546-5bc1-aec6-a8d55d6d7d27" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425360 1080 "\\frac{21}{8}" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425360 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425360 1083 #uuid "0bf2a96f-c565-51af-882e-08be99dbe9d4" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425361 1080 "4" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425361 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425361 1083 #uuid "0f145481-8341-5aa9-b9e3-47ac9653f08d" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425362 1080 "\\frac{e-1}{2}" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425362 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425362 1083 #uuid "201c2488-3b9d-5108-a48b-2c3d64cef328" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425363 1080 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425363 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425363 1083 #uuid "32f46f92-c0b7-5b8c-84c6-59f108c961fb" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425364 1080 "\\frac{2e+3}{4}" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425364 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425364 1083 #uuid "637130b5-f7d6-51c6-b45d-c736d39b3a74" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425365 1080 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425365 1082 #edb/ref 1759