186425378 1072 #uuid "a75bec48-b401-5e54-9492-da413551ed38" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425378 1074 "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ we can calculate the expected value using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\int }_{S}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\n \n\nWe compute the expected value of $X$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\cdot x\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}x\\cdot \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}|}_{0}^{1}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡x{|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-0 \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425379 1068 #edb/ref 17592186425376 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425379 1069 "q-130871" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425379 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425379 1071 "Given that $X$ is a continuous random variable with the following probability density function, compute $\\text{E}[X].$\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}, & 0<x<1 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2x}, & 1\\le x<e\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425379 1072 #uuid "e9404e17-b865-57fd-909a-78dee18906a5" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true] [17592186425379 1074 "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ we can calculate the expected value using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\int }_{S}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\n \n\nWe compute the expected value of $X$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\int }_{0}^{e}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{e}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{e}x\\cdot \\frac{1}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{x}{2}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{e}\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}|}_{0}^{1}+{\\frac{x}{2}|}_{1}^{e} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{e}{2}-\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2e-1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534552 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-0ae0644f-0546-5bc1-aec6-a8d55d6d7d27" 17592186425359 "answer-0bf2a96f-c565-51af-882e-08be99dbe9d4" 17592186425360 "answer-0f145481-8341-5aa9-b9e3-47ac9653f08d" 17592186425361 "answer-201c2488-3b9d-5108-a48b-2c3d64cef328" 17592186425362 "answer-32f46f92-c0b7-5b8c-84c6-59f108c961fb" 17592186425363 "answer-637130b5-f7d6-51c6-b45d-c736d39b3a74" 17592186425364 "answer-65952301-d738-5c6a-b6fc-b85df8529a6a" 17592186425365 "answer-70653d2a-2e94-5850-abe7-6d163b8005a4" 17592186425366 "answer-814d0b3f-29a5-5f01-b16e-f12a0f9ff292" 17592186425367 "answer-88a2d585-fec7-597e-b2b4-33c9d14e2a1a" 17592186425368 "answer-9f712d04-0ef8-55d5-9a8f-397f6820dd55" 17592186425369 "answer-c503e550-36c6-5d75-ad74-9d8d0ffca904" 17592186425370 "answer-ccbfa58e-1e5f-509f-a3c9-671cbe6dad12" 17592186425371 "answer-dea7c8b5-a396-5c8c-a3e3-22fae9de2f74" 17592186425372 "answer-f493205a-4bbe-5f60-96f9-afe578c94f3f" 17592186425373 "answer-field-13b91257-68b8-500a-b201-47daf0478002" 17592186425374 "answer-field-3f402d38-49c1-5e1d-b58d-e1f178a38452" 17592186425375 "answer-field-b56cdda3-d5c2-5ae0-8fb8-26559a6d5135" 17592186425376 "question-127fa900-d0ee-5472-8744-cd34e4c53e66" 17592186425377 "question-a75bec48-b401-5e54-9492-da413551ed38" 17592186425378 "question-e9404e17-b865-57fd-909a-78dee18906a5" 17592186425379}}
